==================================================
GLOBAL SCREEN RULES
==================================================

Every screen must include:

Loading State

Empty State

Offline State

Error State

Accessibility Support

Motion Support

Dark Appearance

Haptic Feedback

Analytics Events

---

Every screen must restore:

Scroll Position

Expanded Sections

Selected Filters

Navigation Context

---

Performance Targets

Launch

<1.5 seconds

Screen Transition

<250ms

Animation

60 FPS minimum

120 FPS on supported devices

Memory

Minimal allocations during scrolling

---

Golden Rule

A screen should communicate its purpose within three seconds.

If users hesitate,

the screen should be redesigned.

